title    Buschkrugallee
about    Seventies acoustic for the slow way home. A strummed Em7 and A swapping bars, a harmonica tune, congas and shaker, and a chorus of voices that lifts through C, G, D and A.
tempo    122
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.3

# E dorian: the C sharp in the A chord is what keeps it sunny.
voice strum guitar    vol=0.55 pan=-0.25
voice harp  accordion vol=0.5  pan=0.15 gate=0.9 bright=1.2
voice hi    voices    vol=0.45 pan=0.2
voice lo    voices    vol=0.4  pan=-0.2
voice bass  ebass     vol=0.7  bright=0.7
voice kick  kick      vol=0.55
voice rim   rim       vol=0.35 pan=-0.2
voice conga conga     vol=0.5  pan=0.3
voice tumba tumba     vol=0.45 pan=0.35
voice shake shaker    vol=0.3  pan=-0.3

pattern intro
strum  | E3+B3+D4+G4- .. E3+B3+D4+G4- E3+B3+D4+G4- .. E3+B3+D4+G4- E3+B3+D4+G4- E3+B3+D4+G4- | A2+E3+A3+B3+E4- .. A2+E3+A3+B3+E4- A2+E3+A3+B3+E4- .. A2+E3+A3+B3+E4- A2+E3+A3+B3+E4- A2+E3+A3+B3+E4- | E3+B3+D4+G4- .. E3+B3+D4+G4- E3+B3+D4+G4- .. E3+B3+D4+G4- E3+B3+D4+G4- E3+B3+D4+G4- | A2+E3+A3+B3+E4- .. A2+E3+A3+B3+E4- A2+E3+A3+B3+E4- .. A2+E3+A3+B3+E4- A2+E3+A3+B3+E4- A2+E3+A3+B3+E4- |
